When you turn into a Deeprock elemental your Arcane damage is increased by [20%, 26%, 30%, 33%, 36% (TL1-5; SP 100)], Arcane damage penetration by [5.9%, 7.9%, 9.3%, 11%, 12% (TL1-5)] and you gain the power to invoke volcanos:

Effective talent level: [2.0, 4.0, 6.0, 8.0, 10 (TL1-5)]

Use mode: Activated

Mana cost: 10

Range: 10

Cooldown: 20

Travel Speed: 200% of base

Usage Speed: Spell (100% of a turn)

Is: a spell

Description: Summons a small raging volcano for [6, 8, 9, 10, 11 (TL1-5)] turns. Every turn, it will fire a molten boulder towards up to [2, 4, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5)] of your foes, dealing [31, 43, 52, 60, 66 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire and [31, 43, 52, 60, 66 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
